<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), Pierre Van Hooydonk</p>
<p>(Celtic)</p>
<p>9 - Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>7 - Paul Wright (Kilmarnock)</p>
<p>6 - Andreas Thom (Celtic)</p>
<p>5 - Ally McCoist (Rangers), Peter Van Vossen (Rangers)</p>
